---
component: afterSchool
effects: true
params:
  who: speaker
  place: { type: { entity: place } }
# (0.27) a beat template: every hangout with a love interest answers `visit`
# at their place, once a day, days 1 to 5, while their route is open.
beat:
  on: visit
  target: "place.@place"
  once: day
  when: "run.day <= 5 && !holds(locked(@who))"
---

## Hangout

// The beat's own lines first, then an hour's affection and one more paper
// lantern folded for the festival.
::body
::set{run.aff[@who] += 1}
::set{run.lanterns += 1}
@narrator: Before the bell, {{@who}} folds a paper lantern with you and writes a wish on it, hiding the words with one hand.
